596da9c))\n* **ci:** bind retained AppHost enrollment and serialize compatibility builds ([986875b](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/986875bfcb5471953378b600710b5d859f3eaba4))\n* cicd ([c1aa20a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/c1aa20ab52460d3445a7bb8de10aea62d1224788))\n* **ci:** pin the module CLI that implements prepare-build ([68c8bd0](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/68c8bd060cab4b315c279c4cf8b0f9994bbf2313))\n* **ci:** refresh projection evidence and published compatibility bindings ([09a3a1d](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/09a3a1dc69702f34418e20777b3633696e08d472))\n* close five deferred admission and replay gaps ([26a269a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/26a269a5a73992d4df79d55460a04d1ab81dbfcc))\n* close five deferred execution validation gaps ([e06da86](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/e06da861c314f54262baab75f802c1496b1ec400))\n* close five deferred measurement gaps ([93be6f2](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/93be6f2f52a7b4a8083208270f3c8bbe87613d30))\n* close five deferred metadata and replay gaps ([91eae8f](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/91eae8f21dd80157824e7d71d4b7a6d64f02ed5c))\n* close five deferred record evidence gaps ([8925c9f](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/8925c9fef46026d53d15478e2a744b3604c38a98))\n* close five deferred record parsing gaps ([b540782](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/b5407828ba39729286dda6efa2f3f963f77f873c))\n* close five deferred record portability gaps ([8947b7d](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/8947b7ddbeaa64d7a039c58a23f99d2a255d2ad0))\n* close five deferred record verification gaps ([92d6c86](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/92d6c86bf1730a56ddf8eb91506acf0afb091e6b))\n* close five deferred repository tooling gaps ([0fe0efb](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/0fe0efb512645f6c3e3df9e64554ed104d0a7b60))\n* close five deferred successor validation gaps ([7630412](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/76304120ac0ab0a793b8c0dc2a04acfe931cffc5))\n* close five deferred validation and tracking gaps ([772f7af](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/772f7af574504492da77efe467293ccd2261906e))\n* correct advisory metadata authorization and label absence ([b3962b0](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/b3962b007804aa47f5130417cd22da8436f79185))\n* epic 16 ([dc5793d](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/dc5793db17fd6974200e80eb2b853187bc5f1669))\n* epic 16 ([053d95e](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/053d95e941c86ca469a4965a39b162294b74c485))\n* epic 16 ([0f179a2](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/0f179a21ad30995eb8ce350c39127926b5c35c25))\n* isolate prerequisite tests from nested submodules ([9911b4c](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/9911b4c9ad26f125a5271fc38f070297e4a9713f))\n* release ([3fa5084](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/3fa50842227ecbbe68a77f10ce68743ac000e26a))\n* spec 5.4 ([8039d2a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/8039d2abcf41bcd2c01fa3dbe618cbec2f4f6da3))\n* story 12.1 ([bb6ae6e](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/bb6ae6e6574377e8fc628266f16b51a301f9736e))\n* story 16.1 ([536bf80](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/536bf80d5fd5c2a64c2f64815edc67074fd5a6ea))\n* story 16.1 ([109ef75](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/109ef750a1ed0d1b02ba7efee8807d611fbad130))\n* story 5.4 ([ffbb947](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/ffbb94767766ab1fab71a3ac83fb34a582126f7f))\n* story 5.4 ([60f1821](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/60f18214d7a4565d28096628af95d867ddd5e874))\n* story 5.4 ([6655e38](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/6655e38743e57ffb85278278dde216663150bd01))\n* submodules ([ed53473](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/ed53473ea4c67aa10ffc46c9b951d9864fe263d4))\n* **tests:** guard a null delivery key before registration ([c71e6ba](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/c71e6ba924f42e7f5da62116f9e3b4fd5d77227e))\n* **test:** stamp only the mapped AppHost configuration ([e78a2e6](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/e78a2e629a2d92be7edcc7776feb9248876fcdef))\n* **test:** treat package-only references as inactive in source mode ([89cbfc0](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Conversations/commit/89cbfc0c8f3c273f0158082ee567ae3779f135e4))\n"}